                         <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-recyclability#TextileChemicalRecyclingEvent
:TextileChemicalRecyclingEvent rdf:type owl:Class ;
                               rdfs:subClassOf :TextileRecyclingEvent ,
                                               [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                 owl:onProperty <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#executesProcessType> ;
                                                 owl:hasValue <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#ChemicalRecyclingProcess>
                                               ] ;
                               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> ;
