                                 <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceType> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingAbstraction> .


###  https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-recyclability#TextileRecyclingEvent
:TextileRecyclingEvent rdf:type owl:Class ;
                       rdfs:subClassOf <https://w3id.org/eudpp#ProductEvent> ,
                                       <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process#TextileProcessExecution> ;
                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-ontology> ;
