                           rdfs:comment "Controlled concept classifying textile waste according to the lifecycle stage at which it became waste."@en ;
                           rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-recyclability> ;
                           rdfs:label "Textile waste source concept"@en ;
                           <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote> "This vocabulary classifies a concrete waste resource and is distinct from RecycledContentSourceConcept, which classifies the declared origin of material already incorporated as recycled content."@en ;
                           <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#sourceLocator> "JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed page 15, lines 188-212; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.4, printed page 130, lines 3487-3509."@en ;
